  "description": "Lately, Yeji's life has been less up and more down. She's barely making ends meet with a dead end part-time job, school's been rough, and her roommate is the worst. Moving in with an old friend just meant that after a year, she had one less friend. Things quickly take a turn when her roommate/former-friend/\"frenemy\" announces she'll be moving out. Too bad Yeji's new roommate wasn't exactly what she was hoping for. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
